## Core Business Units
- [The Swiss Stock Exchange](https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/the-swiss-stock-exchange.html): Trading, listing, and market data services for equities, bond, ETFs. ETPs, sponsored funds and structured products.
- [Financial Information](https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information.html): Data products including reference & pricing data, indices, and regulatory services.
- [Banking Services](https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/banking-services.html): Interbank clearing, payments, ATM outsourcing, debit services and related infrastructure.
- [Securities Services](https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/securities-services.html): Clearing, settlement, custody, tax, and related solutions.

